Winsor -> GreenwichAcademy[label="6.4 (7.11)
04/25", weight="94", tooltip="NEIRA Girls Fours, BB&N vs. Winsor and Greenwich Academy			
Distance: 1350 Conditions: Great conditions overall. Flat water, slight crosswind. Order of racing 6-5-4-3-2-1 Comments: In the G6 race, Winsor caught an over the head crab in the first 100 meters. The crews were realigned, and the race was restarted from about 200 meters in. 
In the G4 race, Greenwich steered off the race course in the last 200 meters, cutting to the finish. It did not impact order of finish, but likely impacted margins.
